\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 2. The authorial diversion: the story of quake-trance and the Box\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 This is where the rich material belongs.\
Crucially, I don't think it needs to pretend to be written by Fridge Force.\
Hayley encounters terms in the report \'97 
\f1\b quake-trance
\f2\b0 , 
\f1\b the Box
\f2\b0 , 
\f1\b Order of the Perpetual Drop
\f2\b0 , and searches outside the closed site (NOTE: there is only so much Hayley will search for; the rest can only be given by an imposition of authorial voice; narratively that could happen before or after Haley POV narrative).\
The diversion itself needs a 
\f1\b single narrative spine
\f2\b0 , rather than headings or successive elaborations:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 There was one Box. Everything happened because of the Box.
\f2\b0 \
That gives you a natural progression.\
Quake-trance begins around one peculiar DJ with one peculiar Box. The Box is carefully positioned relative to the bass equipment. Nobody is allowed inside it. It produces effects that no copycat can reproduce.\
The first drop happens in a warehouse rave. The urban myth that emerges from that drives growth of the future which sends raves out into the desert to accommodate the crowds. At the First Drop, a canyon wall starts humming. Instead of shutting everything down, the DJ adjusts the music. \
The DJ becomes increasingly adept at tuning the music and the Box to the dry desert geography. At this point it must be explicit what quake-trance does in the environment.\
The burnt-sofa party directions are worth keeping, But must be placed with care to maintain POV and narrative continuity:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 DRIVE EAST UNTIL YOUR NAV SAYS, \'93ROAD ENDS IN -10 MILES.\'94\
TURN LEFT AT THE BURNT SOFA.\
\'97\
!!!!!!!!\
IMPORTANT: how quake-trance raves move out from clubs and warehouses to desert canyons (events caused venues to be be condemned due to structural integrity loss) and how the quasi-religion developed. A vital part of this is how it makes raves feel: how the spinning of the gyges disks affected them \'85 there\'92s the effect of vibrations that cannot be heard, potential visions and hallucinations (probably enhanced by the inevitable drug use. QUESTION: what is the companion drug(s) in quake-trance culture \'97MDMA?\'97\'85 it could even be fictional and could carry its own comedy)\
The quasi-religion needs arise naturally from raver experience. Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker must be retained as gods whose lore emerged out of the culture\'92s deep and recurring experience of gyges disk effects. The gods must be explained in my exact words\'94 \'93
\f3\fs22 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 Ludwig was said to preside over beat and thunder-cracks. Zildjian spoke it metallic hisses, rides and crashes, while Rickenbacker grumbled with rolling, subterranean frequencies that were said to exist in the spaces between all other sound, both terrestrial and celestial.\'94
\f2\fs24 \cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \
Never explain the the gods\'92 derivations from musical brands. Readers who recognise them get the extra joke.\
It is important to show the running jokes naturally become urban myth then belief. From belief emerges ritual. From ritual emerges an Order (which the DJ may or may not be part of)\
The Box is now sacred. Its three internal rotating things become 
\f1\b the Platters
\f2\b0 , one associated with each god. Only the DJ really knows what\'92s in the Box.\
That also gives commercialisation a much cleaner role. People can copy the music. They can advertise quake-trance. They can shake floors and sell tickets.\
They cannot make the geology answer because they don't have 
\f1\b the Box
\f2\b0 .\
So the original culture becomes increasingly contemptuous of commercial quake-trance. It needs perhaps one good joke about commercial Drops being conveniently schedulable while genuine ones occur when the gods feels like responding to the box, then move on.\
Eventually the Order declares the desert spiritually overdeveloped and leaves.\
Then comes Goa.\
The bankrupt trance ashram whose previous operators (espousing a balance of mind, body, spirit and cryptocurrency) failed when the cypto-yogi accidentally threw out a disc drive he thought only contained recordings of discredited Neo-Hindu Big Sur Vedas. Keep the narrator's private joke that a remote descendant of Goa trance has unknowingly come home.\
Then 
\f1\b Wet Quake-Trance
\f2\b0  changes the stakes. The whole tradition evolved against dry canyon rock. Goa gives them saturated laterite, groundwater, mud, tidal channels and the Arabian Sea. (Note that the narrative must also provide an equally balanced account of the dry quake-trance) The Box produces effects that seem deeper, stranger and more responsive. Rickenbacker becomes, in the faithful's judgement, markedly more communicative in the tropics.\
Then one service is extraordinarily successful.\
And at that point the diversion can hand control back to Hayley and the Fridge Force report.\
That structure lets virtually all the best material survive without the diversion becoming a catalogue.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 3. Johnny's crime should turn Chip's warning upside down\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 This is where the earlier mathematics becomes useful.\
Sarah gets the Rotherhithe evidence and refuses additional discs.\
Johnny goes behind her back, while openly building the \'93improved 2-disc apparatus on the elliptical track. That any number of articulated disc harness could be mounted on the track remains overlooked until Johnny reveals them prior to the \'93Missing Sock\'94 test\
He already has two. To build the pentagram he needs three more \'97 an interesting accidental echo of the three Platters in the Box \'97 and eventually gets them through the Elvi\'92s heist on shuttered mansions in the mountains.\
The important thing is what he does with five.\
With five discs there are:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 10 pairs + 10 trios + 5 quartets + 1 quintet = 26 resonant groupings.
\f2\b0 \
The Sages' pentagram gives those five a deliberately regular geometry. Johnny's phase compensation and control system lets him bring several groupings into stable coherence simultaneously.\
And here is the useful irony:\

\f1\b it works.
\f2\b0 \
It does not explode.\
It produces a cleaner result.\
It gives them 
\f1\b Missing Socks
\f2\b0 .\
That result should appear to disprove Chip.\
Johnny can quite reasonably conclude that Chip's problem was crude three-disc engineering, excessive speed and uncontrolled resonance. Johnny has five discs, better control, a symmetric configuration and lower operating speeds.\
But the reader later discovers that this inference is exactly backwards.\
Chip feared 
\f1\b coherence
\f2\b0 .\
Johnny regards coherence as his success criterion.\
That is a very good trap.\
The \'93Missing Socks\'94 result then becomes more than a plot discovery. It is the reward that teaches Johnny the wrong lesson:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 More discs + better coherence = better communication.
\f2\b0 \strokec2 \
So naturally he wants to improve the machine further (and he can\'92t resist the temptation of reintroducing rotation speed. Note that two spinning effects are possible with the new apparatus: \
1) disc harnesses mounted on the elliptical track rotate around the track\
2) each disc harness internally spins its disc on a axis like tossing a coin.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 4. What remains for the final confrontation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 This is where 
\f1\b closed resonance
\f2\b0  belongs.\
It should be absent from Hayley's early evidence and absent from the big historical diversion.\
The Rotherhithe investigation contained one deeply technical anomaly that did not matter to Hayley's immediate question and was never reproduced:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 immediately before the Goa configuration collapsed, instruments detected a resonance returning through the generating system;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the return matched the source;\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the return arrived before the corresponding source signal existed
\f2\b0 ;\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 at the same instant, the remote resonance locus ceased being remote and briefly coincided with the Goa apparatus;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Fridge Force called this 
\f1\b closed resonance
\f2\b0 ;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the fixed geometry of the Goa Box could only pass through the condition for an instant;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 an appendix warned that a system whose relative geometry could change continuously while remaining coherent might be able to sustain it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Then Chip sees Johnny's final apparatus.\
Five discs.\
Articulating harnesses.\
Moving around the elliptical track.\
Relative geometry changing continuously.\
Coherence deliberately maintained.\
That is when all the withheld history snaps shut.\
Chip does not realise merely that Johnny might cause 
\f1\b another Rotherhithe
\f2\b0 .\
He realises Johnny has built almost exactly the machine described in the warning.\
And because the reader already knows that Johnny's previous illicit improvement produced 
\f1\b Missing Socks
\f2\b0 , the final escalation does not feel like Johnny suddenly becoming stupid. Every previous violation has produced better results.\
That gives you a very clean four-part progression:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Hayley:
\f2\b0  three discs once did something catastrophically impossible. Stop adding discs.\

\f1\b Authorial diversion:
\f2\b0  here is the ridiculous and increasingly alarming history of the one Box that did it.\

\f1\b Johnny:
\f2\b0  five controlled discs succeed spectacularly, apparently proving that good engineering has solved the danger.\

\f1\b Chip at the end:
\f2\b0  good engineering has actually built the one configuration Fridge Force was afraid might sustain the phenomenon Goa only touched for an instant.\
That preserves the richness while making each appearance of the history reveal something the previous one deliberately did not.\
FOR REFERENCE: HERE IS SOME OLD NOTES for Johnny\'92s previous designs\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

