\cf0 \strokec2 Then Chip sees Johnny's final apparatus.\
Five discs.\
Articulating harnesses.\
Moving around the elliptical track.\
Relative geometry changing continuously.\
Coherence deliberately maintained.\
That is when all the withheld history snaps shut.\
Chip does not realise merely that Johnny might cause 
\f1\b another Rotherhithe
\f2\b0 .\
He realises Johnny has built almost exactly the machine described in the warning.\
And because the reader already knows that Johnny's previous illicit improvement produced 
\f1\b Missing Socks
\f2\b0 , the final escalation does not feel like Johnny suddenly becoming stupid. Every previous violation has produced better results.\
That gives you a very clean four-part progression:\
